    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cThe skeleton awakens. The soul endures.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a forgotten graveyard, left with nothing but a skeletal body and a hazy sense of self. No one knows why you exist\u2014or even who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Shell Soul: The Skull</i>, you play as a mysterious being\u2014conscious, yet stripped of all memories. Embark on a journey through an unfamiliar world, recover fragments of your past, and uncover the truth behind your transformation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey to Find Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll meet unusual monsters who can speak and share their stories. Help them with their troubles, and in return, they will aid you on your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll gradually discover that you are no ordinary skeleton. A hidden power within you may be the last hope to save this broken world\u2014and it\u2019s leading you to the heart of your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Equipment</strong><br>Discover 6 main tools scattered across the world. Each grants you unique abilities that help solve puzzles or access new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Zones</strong><br>Certain areas are blocked until you acquire specific items, encouraging exploration and backtracking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory Fragments</strong><br>Hidden throughout the world, these fragments restore pieces of your lost past and reveal the mystery of your former self.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster-Based Puzzles</strong><br>Use each monster\u2019s traits to solve environmental puzzles and advance through the levels.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cThe skeleton awakens. The soul endures.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a forgotten graveyard, left with nothing but a skeletal body and a hazy sense of self. No one knows why you exist\u2014or even who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Shell Soul: The Skull</i>, you play as a mysterious being\u2014conscious, yet stripped of all memories. Embark on a journey through an unfamiliar world, recover fragments of your past, and uncover the truth behind your transformation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey to Find Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll meet unusual monsters who can speak and share their stories. Help them with their troubles, and in return, they will aid you on your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll gradually discover that you are no ordinary skeleton. A hidden power within you may be the last hope to save this broken world\u2014and it\u2019s leading you to the heart of your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Equipment</strong><br>Discover 6 main tools scattered across the world. Each grants you unique abilities that help solve puzzles or access new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Zones</strong><br>Certain areas are blocked until you acquire specific items, encouraging exploration and backtracking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory Fragments</strong><br>Hidden throughout the world, these fragments restore pieces of your lost past and reveal the mystery of your former self.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster-Based Puzzles</strong><br>Use each monster\u2019s traits to solve environmental puzzles and advance through the levels.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A nameless skeleton awakens in a graveyard. To recover lost memories and uncover the truth, it embarks on a journey of self-discovery.",
